## Recommended First Commands for a New Agent

```bash
cd {repository_root}
cat MENTOR.md
git status
git branch --show-current
git log --oneline -10
cat AGENT_BACKLOG.md
cat OWNERS.md
cat AGENT_OPERATING_PLAN.md
find engineering/workflow -maxdepth 2 -type f -print
```

---

## Definition of Success

The engineering manager is successful when it can safely take one backlog task
from TODO to a final engineering report with:

- deterministic task selection
- explicit plan
- safe branch
- bounded delegation
- persisted state
- automated QA
- criterion-level review
- clear report
- no live trading risk
- no manual copy/paste required for routine operation.
